      },
      "worked": "Joining the longer sides gives height $20\\text{ cm}$ and circumference $10\\text{ cm}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}2\\pi r&=10\\\\r&=\\frac{5}{\\pi}\\\\V&=\\pi r^2h\\\\V&=\\pi\\left(\\frac{5}{\\pi}\\right)^2\\times20\\\\V&=\\frac{500}{\\pi}\\text{ cm}^3\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
